After a multi-step tool call with the Vercel AI SDK, you can access the full conversation history (including assistant and tool messages) from the **final state** or **result object**.

### For `streamText`:
```ts
import { streamText } from 'ai';

const result = await streamText({
  model: yourModel,
  tools: yourTools,
  messages: yourInitialMessages,
});

let fullMessages: Array<{ role: string; content: any }> = [];

for await (const chunk of result.fullStream) {
  if (chunk.type === 'text-delta') {
    // Handle text deltas
  } else if (chunk.type === 'tool-call') {
    // Handle tool calls
  } else if (chunk.type === 'tool-result') {
    // Handle tool results
  } else if (chunk.type === 'finish') {
    // The final chunk contains the full state
    fullMessages = chunk.response.messages; // ✅ All messages (user, assistant, tool)
  }
}

// Save to database
await saveToDatabase(fullMessages);
```

